OL,3,GNEWSAHow parents of murdered stalking
OL,4,Avictim are campaigning for change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decade after the brutal murder of her
OL,7,Fdaughter, Dr Sue Hills still believes
OL,8,Fthere needs to be change.
OL,10,FAlice Ruggles was 24 when she was
OL,11,Fkilled by obsessive ex-boyfriend
OL,12,FTrimaan "Harry" Dhillon in 2016.
OL,14,FOriginally from Leicestershire, Ruggles
OL,15,Fhad been subject to a lengthy campaign
OL,16,Fof stalking from the soldier, who drove
OL,17,Ffrom his barracks near Edinburgh, broke
OL,18,Finto her flat in Gateshead and killed
OL,19,Fher.
